---
import WhatsappFab from '../components/WhatsappFab.astro';
import * as datos from '../lib/business';
import '../styles/global.css';
import Galeria from '../components/Galeria.astro';
import {
	business,
	directionsUrl,
	emailHref,
	facebookUrl,
	instagramUrl,
	mapEmbedUrl,
	mapsUrl,
	phoneHrefs,
	structuredData,
} from '../lib/business';

const title = 'Taberna Lang | Tapas y picoteo en Rincón de la Victoria';
const description =
	'Taberna Lang, taberna de tapas y picoteo en Calle Jaén, 3, Rincón de la Victoria (Málaga). Picoteo del bueno y raciones para compartir. Llama al 605 97 99 06.';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
	<head>
		<meta charset="UTF-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
		<meta name="theme-color" content="#5c1f2b" />
		<meta name="description" content={description} />
		<meta name="robots" content="index, follow" />
		<meta name="geo.region" content="ES-MA" />
		<meta name="geo.placename" content="Rincón de la Victoria" />
		<meta name="geo.position" content={`${business.latitude};${business.longitude}`} />
		<meta name="ICBM" content={`${business.latitude}, ${business.longitude}`} />
		<link rel="canonical" href={`${business.site}/`} />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
		<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
		<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
		<link
			href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:ital,wght@0,500;0,600;0,700;1,500&family=Karla:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Spline+Sans+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap"
			rel="stylesheet"
		/>
		<title>{title}</title>
		<meta property="og:type" content="business.business" />
		<meta property="og:locale" content="es_ES" />
		<meta property="og:site_name" content={business.name} />
		<meta property="og:title" content={title} />
		<meta property="og:description" content={description} />
		<meta property="og:url" content={`${business.site}/`} />
		<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary" />
		<meta name="twitter:title" content={title} />
		<meta name="twitter:description" content={description} />
		<script type="application/ld+json" is:inline set:html={JSON.stringify(structuredData)} />
			<link rel="sitemap" type="application/xml" href="/sitemap-index.xml" />
			<meta property="og:image" content="https://taberna-lang-malaga.vercel.app/og.png" />
		<meta property="og:image:type" content="image/svg+xml" />
		<meta property="og:image:width" content="1200" />
		<meta property="og:image:height" content="630" />
	</head>
	<body>
		<a class="skip-link" href="#contenido">Saltar al contenido</a>
		<header class="site-header">
			<a class="brand" href="#inicio" aria-label="Taberna Lang, inicio"><span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">TL</span><span class="brand-label">TABERNA LANG <small>TAPAS · RINCÓN DE LA VICTORIA</small></span></a>
			<nav aria-label="Navegación principal"><a href="#casa">La casa</a><a href="#contacto">Contacto</a></nav>
			<a class="header-phone" href={phoneHrefs[0]}><span aria-hidden="true">☎</span> {business.phones[0]}</a>
		</header>

		<main id="contenido">
			<section class="hero" id="inicio" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
				<div class="hero-content">
					<p class="eyebrow"><span></span> TABERNA · TAPAS · PICOTEO</p>
					<h1 id="hero-title">Taberna<br /><em>Lang</em></h1>
					<p class="hero-intro">Una taberna con aire familiar de bar de toda la vida, especializada en picoteo del bueno. Tapas y raciones para compartir en Rincón de la Victoria, a dos pasos de la costa.</p>
					<div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-wine" href={phoneHrefs[0]}><span aria-hidden="true">☎</span> Llamar a la taberna</a><a class="button button-ghost" href={directionsUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Cómo llegar <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
					<div class="hero-location"><span class="location-rule" aria-hidden="true"></span><p>{business.city}<br /><strong>{business.province} · {business.region}</strong></p></div>
				</div>
				<aside class="hero-card" aria-label="Información de Taberna Lang">
					<span class="card-sello" aria-hidden="true">LA<br /><i>PRIMERA</i><br />AQUÍ</span>
					<p class="card-kicker">TABERNA DE TAPEO</p>
					<ul class="card-list">
						<li><span>01</span> Tapas y picoteo</li>
						<li><span>02</span> Raciones para compartir</li>
						<li><span>03</span> Vinos y bebidas</li>
					</ul>
					<div class="card-foot">
						<div><small>DIRECCIÓN</small><address>{business.streetAddress}<br />{business.postalCode} {business.city}</address></div>
						<div><small>TELÉFONO</small><a href={phoneHrefs[0]}>{business.phones[0]}</a></div>
					</div>
				</aside>
			</section>

			<section class="salon-strip" id="casa" aria-label="Qué encontrarás en Taberna Lang">
				<p class="strip-title"><span>01 /</span> LA CASA</p>
				<div><span>01</span><strong>Tapas y picoteo</strong></div>
				<div><span>02</span><strong>Raciones para compartir</strong></div>
				<div><span>03</span><strong>Vinos y bebidas</strong></div>
			</section>

			<section class="about-section" aria-labelledby="about-title">
				<p class="section-label"><span>02 /</span> TABERNA LANG · RINCÓN DE LA VICTORIA</p>
				<div class="about-content"><h2 id="about-title">Picoteo<br /><em>del bueno.</em></h2><div><p>Aquí se viene a tapear sin prisas. Un barecito de los de siempre, con trato cercano, donde lo importante es compartir mesa y picar bien: tapas, raciones y bebidas para todos los gustos. Pásate por la taberna o llámanos para reservar.</p><a class="social-link" href={instagramUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Síguenos en Instagram <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div>
				<div class="about-footer"><span>TAPAS · TAPEO · VINOS</span><span>29730 RINCÓN DE LA VICTORIA</span><span>✦</span></div>
			</section>

			<section class="contact-section" id="contacto" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
				<p class="section-label"><span>03 /</span> VISÍTANOS</p>
				<div class="contact-layout">
					<div class="contact-copy"><p class="contact-kicker">ESTAMOS EN CALLE JAÉN</p><h2 id="contact-title">Ven a<br /><em>tapear.</em></h2>
						<div class="contact-card">
							<div class="contact-row"><span aria-hidden="true">⌖</span><div><small>DIRECCIÓN</small><address>{business.streetAddress}<br />{business.postalCode} {business.city}</address></div></div>
							<div class="contact-row"><span aria-hidden="true">☎</span><div><small>LLÁMANOS</small><a href={phoneHrefs[0]}>{business.phones[0]}</a></div></div>
							<div class="contact-row"><span aria-hidden="true">✉</span><div><small>ESCRÍBENOS</small><a href={emailHref}>{business.email}</a></div></div>
						</div>
						<a class="button button-dark" href={directionsUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Abrir indicaciones <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
					</div>
					<div class="map-card"><div class="map-header"><span><i></i> CALLE JAÉN · RINCÓN DE LA VICTORIA</span><a href={mapsUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">ABRIR MAPS ↗</a></div><div style="position:relative;width:100%;min-height:300px;overflow:hidden;border-radius:inherit;">
<iframe title="Mapa de Taberna Lang en Calle Jaén, Rincón de la Victoria" src={mapEmbedUrl} loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade" allowfullscreen></iframe>
						<noscript>
							<p style="margin:0;padding:1rem;text-align:center;"><a href={directionsUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Cómo llegar en Google Maps ↗</a></p>
						</noscript>
					</div><div class="map-footer"><span aria-hidden="true">⌖</span><div><strong>{business.name}</strong><small>{business.streetAddress} · {business.city}</small></div><a href={directionsUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" aria-label="Cómo llegar a Taberna Lang">↗</a></div></div>
				</div>
				<div class="social-row"><span>ENCUÉNTRANOS TAMBIÉN EN</span><a href={instagramUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Instagram ↗</a><a href={facebookUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Facebook ↗</a></div>
			</section>
			<Galeria nombre="Taberna Lang" mapsUrl={mapsUrl} />
		</main>

		<footer class="site-footer"><a class="brand footer-brand" href="#inicio" aria-label="Taberna Lang, volver al inicio"><span class="brand-mark">TL</span><span class="brand-label">TABERNA LANG <small>TAPAS · RINCÓN DE LA VICTORIA</small></span></a><p>{business.streetAddress}, {business.postalCode} {business.city}<br /><a href={phoneHrefs[0]}>{business.phones[0]}</a></p><a class="footer-social" href={instagramUrl} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Instagram ↗</a><small>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Taberna Lang · Rincón de la Victoria &nbsp;·&nbsp; Consulta la carta y los horarios en el local.</small>
			<p style="font-size: 0.75rem; opacity: 0.7; margin: 0.5rem 0 0;">
				<small>Web creada por <a href="https://sur-digital.vercel.app/" rel="noopener">Sur Digital</a></small>
			</p>
</footer>
		<a class="phone-cta" href={phoneHrefs[0]}><span aria-hidden="true">☎</span> Llamar a Taberna Lang <strong>{business.phones[0]}</strong></a>
	<nav class="legal-links" aria-label="Información legal">
					<a href="/aviso-legal">Aviso legal</a>
					<a href="/aviso-legal#privacidad">Privacidad</a>
					<a href="/aviso-legal#cookies">Cookies</a>
				</nav>
						<WhatsappFab phone={datos.phoneHrefs[0]} name={datos.business?.name} />
						</body>
</html>


